  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nIn the attached screen recording you can see when I switch to the Homarr tab there is a slight delay where the page is blank and then has to load in. Also, you can see when scrolling it is not smooth and very jumpy. \n\n[screenRecording.mov.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20761152/screenRecording.mov.zip)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set background image\n2. using Safari \n3. Homarr version 1.24.0\n4. open another tab and wait a minute then go back to the homarr tab\n\n\n\n### Impact\n\n- visual impact \n\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version\n\n1.24.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nUnraid Apps\n\n### Browser\n\nSafari",
